{"about_the_game":"You're a retired war hero. The God, Bheckanos, calls upon you to rid Azmra of the barons now taking residence there.  He arms you with the God Edge; A sword capable of transferring power from the slain to the slayer!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiscover the many secrets hidden around Azmra as you travel from manor to manor and town to town.  Talking to and helping people on your journey may prove useful and offer a deeper perspective on the events that have led Azmra to it's current state.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGod Edge is a 2D pixel art side scroller/platformer that features an open world design and a completely chiptune soundtrack.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeyboard and Xbox 360 Controller are supported though Xbox One Controller is preferred.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Side of Bacon, Please!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1998200/6fb373acb0b1b33fb665a452fd647ae44ada4a84.jpg"},{"name":"Why a Spider?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1998200/28d91ad5cfa84ca21be15c079367eb4f90d7b50d.jpg"},{"name":"Snakes or Dragons?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1998200/1fc20677c2578741a154a8605d1c587da94bd2bd.jpg"},{"name":"Giant Floating Hands?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1998200/c734be4448f596e14bc6316460cd970da8b4e1c6.jpg"},{"name":"Just Like The End of II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1998200/9cf28a712d560f5e1a3077928c865d812c07d9eb.jpg"},{"name":"And So The Cycle Begins Again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1998200/950a2d53946597b68775b4cbea3a5a88d0ae86e4.jpg"},{"name":"Fashion Edge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1998200/816ed496144ba49d05c6050b5d6688b0e9d30b31.jpg"},{"name":"Intentionally Short","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/